\alias{Mobius-package}
\docType{package}
\title{
Mobius Transport for Directional Data
}

\description{
Density evaluation, random generation, and maximum likelihood estimation for the
Möbius-von Mises-Fisher and isotropic scaled von Mises-Fisher distributions on the
hypersphere, introduced in García-Portugués and Kato (2026).
Both distributions arise from Mobius transport of a von Mises-Fisher distribution.
}

